    <node id="&quot;VES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ves was a politician in Manitoba, Canada, serving as a member of the Legislative Assembly of Manitoba from 1958 to 1966. He was educated at Daniel McIntyre College and the University of Manitoba and worked as a chartered accountant before entering politics. He held various positions including member of the St. Vital council and Chairman of Finance and Deputy Mayor.")&lt;SEP&gt;"Ves was a politician in Manitoba, Canada, serving as a member of the Legislative Assembly of Manitoba from 1958 to 1966. He was educated at Daniel McIntyre College and the University of Manitoba. He worked as a chartered accountant before entering political life. He held various positions including member of the St. Vital council and Chairman of Finance and Deputy Mayor.")</data>
